{
  "description": "CPS pin digests (R2 F4). descriptor: a tool's descriptor digest (RFC 8785 over name, description, inputSchema, plus effect, sink and the MCP behaviour hints under annotations when declared), Python ToolDescriptor.digest, which toolset tools and the MCP hub's approvals both use. change (QA-3 PN-13): from each base, every `changed` tool has another digest and every `unchanged` one the base's (provider and annotations that are not behaviour hints are outside the digest). mcpManifest: the version-2 manifestDigest a run pins for an MCP server, the digest of the approved entries of the granted tools only (Python ApprovedManifest.granted_digest, Node mcpPin); null when a granted tool is not approved. mcpManifestMoves (QA-3 MCP-26d): `pinned` is that digest over `approved`, `current` over `reapproved`. Both sections are generated by Python; Node recomputes every digest.",
